  "docTitle": "Recurring Subscriptions & Auto-Orders - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design recurring subscriptions that create orders or charges automatically: a complete entity model, a scheduler for due cycles, idempotent order and charge creation per cycle, mandates and card-on-file flows, retries and dunning, pause, skip and cancel, and which e-commerce services to reuse.",
  "hero": {
    "tag": "header",
    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">45 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Razorpay</span><span class=\"chip company\">PhonePe</span><span class=\"chip company\">Walmart</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Recurring Subscriptions &amp; Auto-Orders</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">\"Two milk packets every Monday.\" \"Charge Rs 499 on the 1st of every month for a year.\" Design the system that remembers those promises, turns each one into exactly one order or one charge per cycle, survives failed payments and holidays, and lets the customer pause, skip or cancel at any time.</p>\n      "
  },
